error[NK1131]: You can't give away `self.items` here: this method only borrows `self`.
   --> tests/a_view_handed_back_is_never_offered_ref.nika:13:4
    |
 13 | 			return self.items
    |    ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
    |
    = note: `self` and `mut self` borrow the value, and `items` is a `Vec[Item]`. Giving it away would take a piece out of something this method doesn't own.
    = help: Write `self.items.clone()` for a copy, or take `keep self` if the method is meant to use up its value. A result that is a view of `self` on every way out is handed back as it is, with no mark.
error[NK1131]: You can't give away `shelf.items` here: `shelf` is only borrowed.
