warning[NK1261]: `ref` is redundant here: a result written `ref String` says what `String` already says.
   --> tests/a_view_handed_back_is_never_offered_ref.nika:40:1
    |
 40 | fn label() -> ref String {
    | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
    |
    = note: Text is a view wherever a view suffices, and the ledger records whether a published parameter is lent or kept and what a result points into (ADR-282 D2). Only an `extern "C"` declaration and a `pub extern fn` write `ref String`, as the pointer C expects.
    = help: Write `String` without `ref`.
